lingmo-settings (5.0.7+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * update page: replace placeholder "Advanced options" navigation item
    with a working release channel selector (Stable/Beta/Nightly) wired
    to UpdateStatus::setChannel(); kept in sync with the service on every
    refresh(). Add footnote explaining each channel.
